  tutorialClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f7145002751c4c4429bb8b341068a561, type: 3}
  subtitleList:
  - There. Do you see those meters lighting up on your dash?
  - "Right in front of you are two meters stacked up \u2014 one red, one blue."
  - "That big red one on the bottom? That shows how steady your mind is\u2014how
    relaxed you are."
  - "When that red bar is full\u2014nice and glowing\u2014that\u2019s your sweet
    spot."
  - "Hold it there long enough, and the blue bar on top starts lighting up\u2014"
  - Section by section, as you see happening right now.
  - "Keep calm and let it fill all the way to the end\u2014"
  - "And boom\u2014you\u2019ll launch a missile straight at the enemy ship ahead."
